# Trivy CVE suppression list for Glacier image scans.
#
# Format: <CVE-ID> # <justification>; expires:<YYYY-MM-DD>
# CI fails any HIGH or CRITICAL not present here.
# Re-triage entries on or before their expiry date.
#
# Example (no entries currently committed; add via PR with rationale):
# CVE-2024-1234 # affects only XML parsing path that Glacier never invokes; expires:2026-07-31
